+# Host cold `backgroundWorks` honesty (claim)
+
+Single Host claim for durable Session evidence that keeps `backgroundWorks`
+honest after memory `eventStore` loss. Sibling toeholds live in
+`bash-background-stop.md` (writers / Stop recovery) and
+`background-agent-stop.md` (Agent Stop settlement). This file is the merged
+**what cold reopen may invent / must not invent** authority.
+
+## Durable Session evidence (claimed)
+
+| Session entry | Writer path | Cold projection |
+|---|---|---|
+| `background_task_completed` | Live Bash + Agent/Task + dwf `BackgroundTaskCompleted` emit (`persistDurableSessionEvent`; toolName-gated) | `BackgroundTaskCompleted` as stored (terminal statuses; `taskKind` bash, subagent, or workflow) |
+| `bash_stop` | `local_bash` Stop / lost settlement | complete Stop → `cancelled`; incomplete / lost → `lost` → panel failed |
+| `subagent_stop` | `local_agent` Stop settlement | complete Stop → `cancelled`; incomplete / pending receipt / resumeIntent → `lost` |
+| `background_task_started` | Live Bash + Agent/Task `BackgroundTaskStarted` emit (toolName-gated); dwf workflow Started **only** when session journal exposes `listNonTerminalRuns` (journal gate) | Bash/Agent **orphan only** → synthesize `BackgroundTaskCompleted` status `lost` (never `running`); workflow orphans **suppressed** as cold (never lost); **warm journal-gated Started read** restores `BackgroundTaskStarted` only when `listNonTerminalRuns` still shows pending/running for the same runId (never invent without journal) |
+| `background_task_updated` | Live Bash + Agent/Task `BackgroundTaskUpdated` **only** when meaningful status/progress control changes (`cancelRequestedAt` / `blocked` / `blockedReason`) — **NOT** 1s poll byte/tail | **no cold panel projection** (never invents `running` / never invents works); **warm overlay** of blocked/cancel onto existing warm running taskIds only; Started orphan→lost + Completed/Stop remain cold authority |
+| `remote_host_attachment_stop` | Host detach · transport_close · WSL idle_dispose (glue `notifyStopped`; fixture `onStopReceipt` DI still for registry-only) | **linked** bash/subagent tasks only → `cancelled`/`lost`; empty linkedTasks → no panel row |
+
+Cold materialization order is owned by
+`COLD_BACKGROUND_WORKS_MATERIALIZATION_ORDER` in
+`cold-background-works-materialization.ts` (driven from
+`loadPersistedConversationMaterialization` / `cold-event-merge.ts`):
+
+```text
+1) background_task_completed
+2) bash_stop          (skip taskIds already covered)
+3) subagent_stop      (skip taskIds already covered)
+4) remote_host_attachment_stop (linked tasks only; skip covered)
+5) background_task_started orphans → lost Completed
+   (skip taskIds already covered; terminal evidence wins)
+```
+
+Per-`RuntimeTaskType` durability policy (`COLD_RUNTIME_TASK_DURABILITY`):
+
+| RuntimeTaskType | Cold policy |
+|---|---|
+| `local_bash` | `session_completed_and_started` (orphan Started → lost) |
+| `local_agent` | `session_completed_and_started` (orphan Started → lost) |
+| `local_dynamic_workflow` | `session_completed_and_started_journal_gated` (Completed durable; Started durable only with `listNonTerminalRuns` gate; cold suppresses orphan — never lost; **warm journal-gated Started read** when journal still non-terminal; never invent without journal) |
+| `local_workflow` | `non_durable` (live BackgroundTask* emit exists with taskKind bash alias; Session persist keys on toolName `Bash` only + refuses `Workflow` — no bash piggyback) |
+| `monitor_mcp` | `non_durable` (empty live BackgroundTask* emit-path; no Monitor tool emit) |
+
+Memory `BackgroundTaskCompleted` for a `taskId` wins over Session supplements for
+that id (no duplicate panel row). Bounded MEMORY_ONLY narrowing: Session-durable
+`BackgroundTaskStarted` (bash / subagent / journal-gated workflow) is **suppressed**
+in cold merge when a `BackgroundTaskCompleted` for the same `taskId` already exists
+in the merge bag (live terminal or Session projection), so stale Started cannot invent
+running after terminal evidence.
+
+```text
+never invent running works
+never invent running / panel works from Session background_task_updated (cold)
+warm Session Updated read overlays blocked/cancel only onto existing warm running taskIds
+warm journal-gated workflow Started read restores Session Started only when listNonTerminalRuns still shows pending/running
+never invent Bash/Agent/CreateWorkflow durability from decorative taskKind alone
+never restart a bash or agent child from cold evidence
+Stop settlement complements live Bash/Agent|Task BackgroundTask* emit-path durability
+Updated Session write is event-driven (cancelRequestedAt / blocked / blockedReason) — NOT 1s poll
+workflow Completed complements dwf journal (workflowRuns); workflow Started is journal-gated (`listNonTerminalRuns`), cold-suppressed (never lost), warm-read when journal still non-terminal
+bounded MEMORY_ONLY narrowing: durable Started ≺ Completed for same taskId
+```
+
+## Proof
+
+| Suite | Covers |
+|---|---|
+| `bash-stop-cold-projection.test.ts` / `bash-stop-recovery.test.ts` | `bash_stop` alone |
+| `subagent-stop-cold-projection.test.ts` | `subagent_stop` alone |
+| `background-task-completed-durability.test.ts` | live Bash Completed |
+| `background-task-started-durability.test.ts` | orphan Bash Started → lost |
+| `agent-background-task-durability.test.ts` | live Agent Started/Completed + orphan Agent → lost + Completed≻subagent_stop |
+| `workflow-background-task-completed-durability.test.ts` | live workflow Completed + journal-gated Started persist / cold suppress / warm journal-gated Started read (never lost / never invent without journal) |
+| `background-task-updated-durability.test.ts` | event-driven Updated persist (meaningful only; refuse 1s poll) + warm overlay blocked/cancel + empty cold synth + Updated-only SQLite invent refuse |
+| `host-cold-background-works-honesty.test.ts` | **multi-source** SQLite reopen + precedence across the four entry types (+ workflow Completed) + bounded MEMORY_ONLY narrowing (durable Started ≺ Completed) + Updated invent refuse |
+| `cold-background-works-materialization.test.ts` | ordered projector registry + RuntimeTaskType durability table + local_workflow/monitor_mcp non_durable proof + bash-kind alias honesty (toolName-gated) + multi-source runner (no invent running) |
+| `remote-host-attachment-stop-session.test.ts` | `remote_host_attachment_stop` persist + linked-task cold projection + empty invent refuse + SQLite reopen |
+
+Wired into `pnpm test:kernel-recovery`.
+
