+Sibling toehold docs (`bash-background-stop.md`, `background-agent-stop.md`) describe writers /
+Stop detail only; cold reader path is the registry above — not an incomplete hardcoded chain.
+
+## Explicitly not claimed
+
+- Inventing `running` / panel `backgroundWorks` from Session `background_task_updated` alone (Updated is not a cold projector; warm overlay requires existing warm running evidence; 1s poll byte/tail Session writes remain refused)
+- Workflow `BackgroundTaskUpdated` durability
+- Full removal of `BackgroundTaskCompleted` / non-gated Started from cold-merge `MEMORY_ONLY` (Completed stays live terminal authority; live Updated stays MEMORY_ONLY for warm UI)
+- Preferring Session Completed over live memory Completed for the same taskId (memory Completed still wins)
+- Workflow `BackgroundTaskStarted` orphan→lost / inventing `running` from Session Started alone without journal non-terminal (journal-gated persist + cold suppress + warm journal-gated read only)
+- Generic multi-type cold RuntimeTask reconstruct beyond the ordered registry toehold (bash + local_agent + journal-gated workflow Started + workflow Completed; `monitor_mcp` empty emit-path / dedicated `local_workflow` keep `non_durable` with persist-path proof)
+- Reconstructing `workflowRuns` / dwf journal from BackgroundTask* (journal remains authority)
+- Live SSH/WSL/Docker/MessagePort / remote process-tree discovery of linked tasks (fixture `resolveLinkedTasks` DI only; see `remote-host-attachment-stop.md`)
+- Live Electron MessagePort e2e remote agent SQLite under real detach (MessagePort-shaped fixture e2e + product bindSession/setPersist/protocol claimed; live Electron / live SSH still non-claim; see `remote-host-attachment-stop.md`)
+- Inventing `running` `backgroundWorks` from durable Started alone or empty remote stop receipts
