+# Plugin / MCP surface honesty (wired vs usable)
+
+**Module:** Settings Plugin MCP projection + third-party grant surface  
+**Claim owner:** `packages/ui/src/settings/pluginMcpSurfaceHonesty.ts` +
+`buildPluginMcpServerItems` in `pluginManagedResourceGroups.ts`
+
+## Horizontal compare (OSS)
+
+| Source | Pattern used here |
+|---|---|
+| **VS Code** (`McpConnectionState`) | Configured ≠ Running. Stopped / Starting / Running / Error. Live tools require a connected server — `mcp.json` alone never invents Ready. |
+| **Claude Code / ACP** | Capability flags report truth; discovery does not invent usable tools from scaffold. |
+| **Fleet AGENTS.md** | Only `usable` · `wired but not visually checked` · `display-only` · `not implemented`. "Mostly done" / invent Ready are forbidden. |
+| **ZCode grants** (`plugin-grants.test.ts`) | Third-party MCP stays out of `mcpServerNames` until the person allows the exact declared fingerprint. |
+
+## Labels (runtime projection)
+
+| Honesty | Meaning | Product `usable` / invent `Ready` |
+|---|---|---|
+| `declared_wired` | Manifest / grant declaration only (`declaredMcpServerNames`); runtime has not injected | **impossible** |
+| `runtime_wired` | Injected (`mcpServerNames` / active) without a live status snapshot | **impossible** |
+| `connecting` / `connected` / `disconnected` / `error` / `unknown` | Live MCP transport states | **impossible** (connection ≠ owner-accepted usable) |
+| `plugin_disabled` | Plugin off; declaration may still show for provenance | **impossible** |
+
+Product register `usable` still requires owner visual acceptance. Connected transport
+must not be paraphrased as "available" / Ready in Settings copy.
+
+## Proof
+
+| Check | Location |
+|---|---|
+| Classifier refuses usable/Ready for every label | `pluginMcpSurfaceHonesty.test.ts` |
+| Grant-pending declared MCP → `declared_wired`, `active: false` | same |
+| Injected without snapshot → `runtime_wired` | same |
+| Connected snapshot → `connected`, still not product usable | same |
+| Missing package never invents `packageStatus: "available"` | same + `pluginCapabilityProjection` fixture |
+| Wired into | `pnpm test:fleet-local` |
+
+## Non-claims
+
+- Does not promote ORCH-04 / ORCH-11 / ORCH-12 to register `usable`
+- Does not invent live SSH/WSL/Docker MCP e2e
+- Does not invent monitor_mcp durability, local_workflow promote, Updated poll, Craft baseline, signing, or force-push
