+# Remote Host / attachment Stop lifetime (+ Session cold writer + Host glue + product bind + WSL idle + MessagePort-shaped e2e)
+
+Local ACP / MCP process-tree Stop is DI-proven (`process-tree-terminator`, Job Object,
+ACP close). Remote Host Stop still cannot invent a live SSH/WSL/Docker transport on a
+Mac unit fixture. This toehold scaffolds the **attachment registry + connection
+registry Stop contract** with injectable connect / expose / **MessagePort-shaped**
+port close — the same Host wiring Main uses when a remote logical session goes
+offline — persists honest stop/detach receipts into Session, and maps
+**remoteSessionId → SessionId** on production Host `onSessionClosed` / dispose so
+real detach can write `remote_host_attachment_stop` without fixture-only DI.
+MessagePort-shaped fixture e2e proves detach→Session write without live Electron
+MessagePort or SSH invent.
+
+## This toehold
+
+```text
+injectable connect / expose / MessagePort-shaped port
+  → attach / replace / detach / generation stale detach
+MessagePortMain-shaped fixture port (close/start/postMessage/once("close")):
+  port.close → dispose expose handle (no Session invent on close alone)
+  Host Stop capture→detach→glue/product Session write (session_detach|transport_close)
+transport onDidClose → onSessionClosed → detachRemoteSessionAttachments
+  → writeRemoteHostAttachmentStopOnHostClose (transport_close)
+DisposeRemoteWorkspaceSession: detach → session_detach glue write → disposeSession
+WSL idle TTL → registry onIdleDispose → glue notifyStopped(idle_dispose)
+  (Host snapshots SessionIds before session_detach clears live bindings)
+cancelConnect + late connect success → dispose, never resurrect
+SSH disposeSession may keep window-scoped connection; attachments still detach
+WSL disposeSession schedules idle connection dispose (short fixture TTL);
+  running workspace tasks delay idle teardown; attachments stay detached
+Host→SessionStore glue:
+  bindSession(remoteSessionId, SessionId) → notifyStopped / onSessionClosed / idle_dispose
+  optional sessionIds override for WSL idle after binding clear
+  injected persist writer; never invents linkedTasks
+Product bindSession + setPersist:
+  wrap IZCodeSessionService create/resume when remoteSessionId set
+  capture agent writer per SessionId at bind (offline-safe at transport_close / idle)
+  protocol session/persistRemoteHostAttachmentStop → core persist receipt
+fixture DI onStopReceipt (still available for registry-only proofs):
+  session_detach | transport_close | idle_dispose receipts
+  optional resolveLinkedTasks → Session remote_host_attachment_stop entry
+cold projector (linked tasks only) → BackgroundTaskCompleted cancelled|lost
+never invent running / never invent live remote process-tree termination
+never invent live Electron MessagePort / real SSH/WSL/Docker path
+never invent a new BackgroundTask taskKind
+```
+
+- Attachment registry: `packages/desktop/src/host/windowHostAttachmentRegistry.ts`
+- Connection registry: `packages/desktop/src/host/windowRemoteConnectionRegistry.ts`
+- Host composition (production): `onSessionClosed` → detach +
+  `writeRemoteHostAttachmentStopOnHostClose`; WSL `onIdleDispose` →
+  `notifyStopped({ reason: "idle_dispose" })` in `packages/desktop/src/host/index.ts`
+- Host→SessionStore glue:
+  `packages/desktop/src/host/remoteHostAttachmentStopSessionGlue.ts`
+  (`bindSession`, injected `persist`, `writeRemoteHostAttachmentStopOnHostClose`)
+- Product wiring:
+  `packages/desktop/src/host/remoteHostAttachmentStopProductWiring.ts`
+  (wrap session service + setPersist router; Host InitLocal + remote collection)
+- Protocol: `session/persistRemoteHostAttachmentStop` → bootstrap →
+  `persistRemoteHostAttachmentStopReceipt` (no linkedTasks on wire)
+- Fixture: `packages/desktop/test/helpers/remote-host-attachment-stop-fixture.ts`
+  (`connectDocker` / `connectSsh` / `connectWsl`, `wslIdleTtlMs`, `onStopReceipt`,
+  `createMessagePortShapedAttachmentPort`)
+- Session writer / cold projector:
+  `apps/zcode-cli/packages/core/src/runtime/methods/remote-host-attachment-stop-settlement.ts`
+- Proof: `packages/desktop/test/remote-host-attachment-stop.test.ts` +
+  `packages/desktop/test/remote-host-attachment-stop-session-glue.test.ts` +
+  `packages/desktop/test/remote-host-attachment-stop-product-wiring.test.ts` +
+  `packages/desktop/test/remote-host-attachment-stop-messageport.test.ts` +
+  `apps/zcode-cli/packages/core/test/remote-host-attachment-stop-session.test.ts`
+- Wired into `pnpm test:native-executor` + `pnpm test:kernel-recovery`
+
+## Explicitly not claimed
+
+- Live SSH / WSL / Docker transport Stop or remote process-tree teardown
+- Live Electron `MessagePort` attachment plumbing / MessagePortProtocol ChannelServer e2e
+  (MessagePort-**shaped** fixture e2e claimed: close→dispose + Host Stop→Session write)
+- Remote ACP/MCP child termination across the wire
+- Live end-to-end Electron MessagePort + remote agent SQLite write under real detach
+  (MessagePort-shaped + product bind→persist router→SQLite-shaped entry claimed;
+  production Host wrap installed; live Electron / live SSH still non-claim)
+- Discovering linked tasks from a live remote process tree (resolveLinkedTasks is DI;
+  production glue never invents `linkedTasks`)
+- Widening BackgroundTask `taskKind` beyond bash / subagent / workflow
+- Inventing Session `remote_host_attachment_stop` from MessagePort close alone
+  (close disposes expose handle; Host Stop owns Session write)
