+# Session control steerable honesty (composer-facing)
+
+**Module:** v4 `ConversationSnapshot.control.steerable`  
+**Claim owner:** `sessionControlSchema` + TurnStarted / TurnSteerableChanged →
+ProductProjection + `computeInputRouting` (prefers `control.steerable`) +
+`classifyNativeGuideHonestyFromSnapshotControl` / `projectPendingGuideQueue`
+
+## Horizontal compare
+
+| Source | Pattern used here |
+|---|---|
+| **Core `activeTurn.steerable`** | Assigned in `turn.ts` from `nativeGuideSteerAllowed()` (native) or `true` (Pi). Gate open ≠ product Ready (`native-guide-tool-boundary-honesty.md`). |
+| **Product UI Guide labels** | Steerable ≠ Ready / usable (`native-guide-surface-honesty.md`). |
+| **Plugin MCP honesty** | Wired / connected ≠ invent Ready. |
+| **Prior inputRouting proxy** | `mode === "guide"` alone overclaimed when the live turn bit was false; `computeInputRouting` now prefers `control.steerable`. |
+
+## Projection
+
+| Stage | Behavior |
+|---|---|
+| `TurnStarted.steerable` | Core copies `activeTurn.steerable` onto the event (regular agent turns). **Sole path that may set `control.steerable` true.** |
+| `CanonicalUserIntentFact.steerable` | Normalizer passes the optional bit through. |
+| `snapshot.control.steerable` | Agent `onTurnStarted` sets `fact.steerable === true`; turn terminal / empty activeWorks clears to `false`. |
+| `TurnSteerableChanged` | Live mid-turn **clear-only** (`steerable: false`) before TurnComplete — patches `control.steerable` while turn still running. Payload `true` is refused (cannot invent Ready / open). |
+| Legacy / controlOnly / compact events | Bit absent → `false` (underclaim; never Ready invent). |
+| Draft initial snapshot | `steerable: false` |
+
+## Emit path (live clear)
+
+`clearActiveTurnSteerable()` sets `activeTurn.steerable = false` then appends
+`TurnSteerableChanged{steerable:false}` (idempotent when already false). Wired at
+text-only / stop-tool / output-limit / UserPromptSubmit-block settle sites so
+composer honesty matches admission before TurnComplete accounting.
+
+## Composer-facing honesty
+
+| Facts | Honesty |
+|---|---|
+| `inputRouting.mode === "guide"` + `control.steerable === true` | `steerable` |
+| `inputRouting.mode === "guide"` + `control.steerable === false` | `not_steerable` (legacy overlay; live routing should not stay `guide`) |
+| Other routing modes | Unchanged (`queue_path` / `no_active_turn` / reject codes) |
+| Product `usable` / invent `Ready` | **impossible** for every label |
+
+## `computeInputRouting` prefers `control.steerable`
+
+Running / prewarming + `followupMode === "guide"`:
+
+| `control.steerable` | `inputRouting` |
+|---|---|
+| `true` | `{ mode: "guide" }` |
+| `false` | `{ mode: "enqueue", reasonCode: "turn_not_steerable" }` |
+
+`followupMode === "queue"` stays enqueue regardless of the bit. Mid-turn
+`TurnSteerableChanged` clear recomputes routing via `controlPatch` so sendText
+(which maps `inputRouting.mode` → `requestedDelivery`) stops advertising Guide
+when the live bit clears. Steerable ≠ Ready / usable.
+
+## Proof
+
+| Check | Location |
+|---|---|
+| Schema requires `steerable`; initial draft is false | `session-control-steerable.test.ts` |
+| TurnStarted `steerable:true` → control true (≠ Ready) | same |
+| Mid-turn `TurnSteerableChanged` clears before TurnComplete while running | same |
+| Mid-turn `steerable:true` payload cannot invent open | same |
+| Guide + `steerable:false` → `not_steerable` | `nativeGuideSurfaceHonesty.test.ts` |
+| Guide + `steerable:true` → `steerable`, never Ready | same |
+| Pending Guide projection prefers control bit | same |
+| `computeInputRouting` guide requires steerable; else enqueue `turn_not_steerable` | `session-control-steerable.test.ts` |
+| Mid-turn clear flips `inputRouting` guide → enqueue | same |
+| Wired into | `pnpm test:fleet-local` |
+
+## Non-claims
+
+- Does **not** invent product Ready / usable (steerable = admission bit only)
+- Does not invent product Ready when routing becomes guide (steerable gate open ≠ Ready)
+- Does not flip Craft baseline, signing, force-push, monitor_mcp invent, or 1s poll
+- Does not invent live Electron MessagePort e2e or page-Agent visual e2e (MessagePort-shaped remote Host Stop fixture e2e is separate; see `remote-host-attachment-stop.md`)
+- CU composer toolbar entry visibility/UI-state is separate; see `cua-composer-entry-honesty.md`
+- `TurnSteerableChanged` is clear-only — never a second open path beside TurnStarted
